# Timeline / Gantt (new)

Purpose: duration and overlap — instances as bars between two date
fields. Exists because calendars show points; projects are spans, and
collisions/dead zones only show on a horizontal time axis.

Size/position: drag + resize on the canvas (dnd), never in the menu.
Relevancy: 🔥 core · ⭐ valuable · 💤 later

| Option | Category | Relevancy | Values / default | Notes |
