| title | display | 🔥 | text | |
| startField / endField | data | 🔥 | date fields | end optional -> milestone diamond |
| concept | filter | 🔥 | conceptId | |
| conditions | filter | 🔥 | SidebarCondition[] | |
| match | filter | 🔥 | all / any | |
| group by | display | ⭐ | none / enum / user field | swimlane rows |
